abstract: >
  A deterministic interceptor architecture that forces safety into any
  LLM agent by operating as a reverse proxy at the HTTP boundary between
  agent and model provider. Integrates subsumption architecture, dual-
  process theory, cybernetics, and embodied world models into a single
  coercive — rather than cooperative — safety layer.
